# Copy to .env for the local Compose stack. Keep it out of version control.
#
# There is no master key any more: this service mints and stores no
# credential. Operator authority is configuration over an identity some
# provider below already resolved. Both default to empty, which grants
# nobody -- name yourself here to reach the audit log, bank clear/delete,
# slug release, the fleet view and On-Behalf-Of delegation.
MEMORY_MASTER_USERS=
MEMORY_MASTER_GROUPS=
# Which provider may grant the authority above, as its issuer. Required once
# more than one identity provider is enabled: a subject is only unique within
# the issuer that minted it, and the caller picks the provider by picking the
# header. The service refuses to start rather than grant ambiguously.
MEMORY_MASTER_ISSUER=
HINDSIGHT_LLM_PROVIDER=mock
HINDSIGHT_LLM_MODEL=mock-model
HINDSIGHT_LLM_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:9
HINDSIGHT_LLM_API_KEY=dummy

# The Compose stack wires the `dev-identity` sidecar through the platform
# provider for you -- see docker-compose.yml. Set MEMORY_MASTER_USERS above to
# whatever token you plan to send if you need the operator plane locally.

# External identity for a real deployment (both providers may be enabled
# together). Setting these here overrides the compose defaults.
# The issuer must match the token's `iss` claim exactly, so it stays the
# public URL even when JWKS is fetched in-cluster -- override the JWKS URI
# for that.
# MEMORY_AUTH_JWT_ENABLED=true
# MEMORY_AUTH_JWT_ISSUER=https://ach.example.com
# MEMORY_AUTH_JWT_JWKS_URI=http://ach.ach.svc/.well-known/jwks.json
# MEMORY_AUTH_JWT_AUDIENCE=mcp:ach-memory
# MEMORY_AUTH_JWT_VERIFY_AUDIENCE=true
# MEMORY_AUTH_JWT_GROUPS_CLAIM=groups
# MEMORY_AUTH_PLATFORM_ENABLED=true
# Comma-separated, tried in order, first present wins. List both to accept
# a gateway's own header and a local client's Authorization bearer at once:
# MEMORY_AUTH_PLATFORM_INCOMING_HEADER=x-litellm-api-key,authorization
# MEMORY_AUTH_PLATFORM_RESOLVER_HEADER=x-litellm-api-key
# MEMORY_AUTH_PLATFORM_RESOLVER_URL=http://litellm.genai.svc/v2/user/info
# MEMORY_AUTH_PLATFORM_CACHE_TTL=300
# MEMORY_AUTH_PLATFORM_GROUPS_FIELD=team_id

